      "text": "\u201cSweetheart\u201d is sweet,\n\u201cdarling\u201d is nice,\nand \u201cbaby\u201d is okay and all."
    },
    {
      "slide": 2,
      "source": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/source-art/slide-02-source.png",
