        1080,
        1920
      ],
      "font": "/System/Library/Fonts/Noteworthy.ttc",
      "font_size": 68,
      "text": "But you\u2019re more than any word\nI already knew.\nYou\u2019re my Zuv."
    },
    {
      "slide": 3,
      "source": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/source-art/slide-03-source.png",
