      "size": [
        1080,
        1920
      ],
      "font": "/System/Library/Fonts/Noteworthy.ttc",
      "font_size": 68,
      "text": "Zuv is a Kashmiri word.\nIt means life.\nIt means soul."
    },
    {
      "slide": 4,
      "source": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/source-art/slide-04-source.png",
      "final": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/final-stories/slide-04.png",
      "size": [
        1080,
        1920
      ],
      "font": "/System/Library/Fonts/Noteworthy.ttc",
      "font_size": 68,
      "text": "A way of saying\nyou\u2019re not just someone I love.\nYou\u2019re the life inside it."
    },
    {
      "slide": 5,
      "source": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/source-art/slide-05-source.png",
      "final": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/final-stories/slide-05.png",
      "size": [
        1080,
        1920
      ],
      "font": "/System/Library/Fonts/Noteworthy.ttc",
      "font_size": 60,
      "text": "The quiet I look for.\nThe breath I come back to.\nThe person everything softens around."
    },
    {
      "slide": 6,
      "source": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/source-art/slide-06-source.png",
      "final": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/final-stories/slide-06.png",
      "size": [
        1080,
        1920
      ],
      "font": "/System/Library/Fonts/Noteworthy.ttc",
      "font_size": 68,
      "text": "Put simply,\nZuv is the only word\nthat comes close to you."
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "source": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/source-art/slide-07-source.png",
      "final": "output/carousels/2026-06-24/zuv-one-word/final-stories/slide-07.png",
      "size": [
        1080,
        1920
